#: 0ad26007bf7e4a52906a9ef9a8e41b8c
msgid "将哈密顿量或重叠矩阵从原子轨道基组展开为球谐函数基组。"
msgstr "Expand Hamiltonian or overlap matrices from atomic orbital basis sets to spherical harmonic basis sets."

#: e761a1c9a0e046b6a7e8d3d163e1b2b9
msgid ""
"该模块的核心操作是执行以下基组变换，将原子轨道 :math:`|l_i, m_i \\rangle` 和 :math:`|l_j, m_j "
"\\rangle` 耦合为总角动量 :math:`|L, M \\rangle` 的不可约表示："
msgstr ""
"The core operation of this module is to perform the following basis transformation, coupling atomic orbitals :math:`|l_i, m_i \\rangle` and :math:`|l_j, m_j "
"\\rangle` into an irreducible representation of the total angular momentum :math:`|L, M \\rangle`:"

#: a4b74d08739d42f1acda070ed5ba7aad
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"O_{LM} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{m_i, m_j} C_{l_i m_i, l_j m_j}^{L M} \\cdot "
"H_{l_i m_i, l_j m_j}"
msgstr ""
"O_{LM} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{m_i, m_j} C_{l_i m_i, l_j m_j}^{L M} \\cdot "
"H_{l_i m_i, l_j m_j}"

#: c6ac21aecfe443cc8b7e324532d00621
msgid "其中 :math:`C` 是 Clebsch-Gordan 系数。"
msgstr "where :math:`C` are the Clebsch-Gordan coefficients."

#: 5f3e101acf4c4ee5a9711d1ad655ec49
msgid ""
"该模块还能处理不同DFT软件（如 'openmx', 'siesta', 'abacus'）的原子轨道排序约定， 并将它们统一转换为 e3nn "
"库兼容的不可约表示 (irreps) 形式。"
msgstr ""
"This module can also handle atomic orbital ordering conventions from different DFT software (e.g., 'openmx', 'siesta', 'abacus') and convert them into a unified format of irreducible representations (irreps) compatible with the e3nn "
"library."

#: e2047ddc4bde447bac6af8451e7e2a26
