#: 85784ca2ba454be7ae5a0a0bd06b602b
msgid "预计算和存储 Clebsch-Gordan (CG) 系数的模块。"
msgstr "A module to precompute and store Clebsch-Gordan (CG) coefficients."

#: 69b24afcff1c482ebe28c89f3cea5da5
msgid ""
"该模块利用 `e3nn.o3.wigner_3j` 来计算 Wigner 3j 符号，并通过它们得到 CG 系数。 Wigner 3j 符号与 "
"CG 系数通过以下关系相关联："
msgstr ""
"This module uses `e3nn.o3.wigner_3j` to compute Wigner 3j symbols and derives CG coefficients from them. The Wigner 3j symbols are related to the CG coefficients by:"

#: 88cb16ba99b94b348ddd06210e83fa30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\langle l_1 m_1, l_2 m_2 | l_3 m_3 \\rangle =\n"
"(-1)^{l_1 - l_2 + m_3} \\sqrt{2l_3 + 1}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix} l_1 & l_2 & l_3 \\\\ m_1 & m_2 & -m_3 \\end{pmatrix}"
msgstr ""
"\\langle l_1 m_1, l_2 m_2 | l_3 m_3 \\rangle =\n"
"(-1)^{l_1 - l_2 + m_3} \\sqrt{2l_3 + 1}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix} l_1 & l_2 & l_3 \\\\ m_1 & m_2 & -m_3 \\end{pmatrix}"

#: a97fa7d6596d4f4493e4c6f45eca028e
msgid "此版本经过重构，以实现完整的JIT兼容性和新旧模型双向兼容。 所有兼容性逻辑都被封装在此类内部，对外部代码完全透明。"
msgstr "This version has been refactored for full JIT compatibility and backward compatibility with older models. All compatibility logic is encapsulated within this class, making it transparent to external code."

#: 6a422980999c4189b6a67d5fd4dfba67
