msgstr "Maintain backward compatibility, state_dict keeps the standard format."

#: 9923162337b84a5198eff7f799dcaa00
msgid "一个线性缩放模块，其权重由外部提供。"
msgstr "A linear scaling module whose weights are provided externally."

#: 3b8305ace1af4398ba4afa523a6e2ab3
msgid ""
"该模块首先通过张量积(tensor product)将输入特征与一个伪标量(pseudo-scalar)相乘， "
"然后应用一个外部提供的权重向量。最后，通过一个线性层将结果映射到输出的不可约表示。"
msgstr ""
"This module first multiplies the input features with a pseudo-scalar via a tensor product, "
"then applies an externally provided weight vector. Finally, the result is mapped to the output irreducible representations through a linear layer."

#: c4007f4aad5d46d9af463d9a9e135648
msgid "带权重的线性变换前向传播。"
msgstr "Forward pass for the weighted linear transformation."

