msgid "该函数在接近截断半径时平滑地将值过渡到零。"
msgstr "This function smoothly transitions values to zero as they approach the cutoff radius."

#: 300ebb31801442eda03aa5bb5a0fade5
msgid "应用截断的距离。"
msgstr "The distance at which to apply the cutoff."

