msgstr "The resulting edge weight tensor after applying the cutoff."

#: 66fe1a74e0b64d66ab856e4e6c2f8046
msgid "计算图中每个节点的邻居数量。"
msgstr "Calculate the number of neighbors for each node in the graph."

#: ff6ecb7877ef4778ad4e8a4b54905eb8
