msgstr "A 1D tensor containing the source node indices (usually `edge_index[0]`)."

#: e0517f59f27b4a1dab8f45675ef737f7
msgid "一个张量，其索引对应节点ID，值为该节点的邻居数量。"
msgstr "A tensor where the index corresponds to the node ID and the value is the number of neighbors for that node."

#: d6cea25b19014a01ac502c1844ef7b39
msgid "一个带有内存优化和动态权重的张量积模块。"
msgstr "A tensor product module with memory optimization and dynamic weights."

#: c550f4f176ab43f3b698b4d9b7c24e4a
msgid "该模块通过一个径向多层感知机(MLP)或KAN网络从标量输入动态生成权重， 然后将这些权重应用于两个输入不可约表示(irreps)的张量积结果。"
msgstr "This module dynamically generates weights from a scalar input via a radial MLP or KAN network, and then applies these weights to the tensor product of two input irreps."

#: 7215e9c6c3ef421b8db01b467d5e6973
msgid "TensorProductWithMemoryOptimizationWithWeight 模块的前向传播。"
msgstr "Forward pass for the TensorProductWithMemoryOptimizationWithWeight module."

#: 715e81bd54d5426c8f69c8f7d43c14fe cf7a4304d45d4e0a9a26f2c2e97b2c80
msgid "第一个不可约表示的输入张量。"
msgstr "Input tensor for the first irreps."

#: 545d4bdbf41d4fc6ad106f745c59edd8 db8dadb98f354dceaa36bb4a50d0f2d9
msgid "第二个不可约表示的输入张量。"
msgstr "Input tensor for the second irreps."

#: 114266918da54941a4bd59243e72219d
