msgid "应用张量积和缩放后的输出张量。"
msgstr "The output tensor after applying the tensor product and scaling."

#: 60d6c569536848c691d28767313f1831
msgid "一个带内存优化的张量积模块，专门处理至少一个输入是标量的情况。"
msgstr "A tensor product module with memory optimization, specialized for cases where at least one input is a scalar."

#: 5ee005892cd445cda23f6997869cc4d0
msgid "从给定的不可约表示中提取并返回标量不可约表示。"
msgstr "Extracts and returns the scalar irreps from a given set of irreps."

#: 881fc6b4e52f4d55a620905a095b9896
msgid ""
"标量不可约表示定义为 l=0 且 p=1 (即 '0e') 的表示。 该函数计算此类标量不可约表示的总多重度，并构造一个仅包含这些表示的新 "
"Irreps 对象。"
msgstr "Scalar irreps are defined as representations with l=0 and p=1 (i.e., '0e'). This function calculates the total multiplicity of such scalar irreps and constructs a new Irreps object containing only them."

#: 8eb1e5a8ccd447a097c7162da8f2b3b3
msgid "要从中提取标量分量的输入不可约表示。"
msgstr "The input irreps from which to extract the scalar components."

#: 0879352b58274db490f00067d138a348
msgid "仅包含标量分量的新 Irreps 对象。"
